WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.760
His name is Zhong Man, he is a fisherman.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:30.730
In fact, his cormorants fish for him.
He taught them to fetch fish.

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.050
All the fishermen do that here. But
in the area Zhong Man is a celebrity.

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:51.670
His birds catch the biggest fish
of the river. He trained them for that.

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:58.730
Every year, Zhong Man raises a small cormorant and
he wants him to be even better than the others.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:02.780
For that, he needs an egg and not just any egg.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.510
Again, Zhong Man has his little secrets.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:35.360
Zhong Man has twelve cormorants, all of them male.
The eldest is called Boiteux,

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:37.820
He was his best fisherman for years.

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:41.660
Under water, he could see far. Very far.

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:49.280
He is the son of the lame.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.890
Plumonge and his brother are still
like that. Zhong Man can't help it.

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:23.390
He is a sleeper. When he's not fishing, he's sleeping.

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:35.270
There is also fout camp and a dancer. They are all
able to take out eight to 10 pounds of fish per day.

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:47.610
But the best this year, the one that brings back the
bigger is Mao. Zhong Man decided to marry him,

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:50.340
To be the father of the new generation.

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.840
Mao was raised with Zhong Man's grandson.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:41.600
You have to learn the language of the
cormorants. Afterwards, we no longer understand anything.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:49.100
And with these birds, it is better to be obeyed very early.
Mao and the child, play, eat and sleep together,

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:53.060
Since their birth. Zhong Man was also brought up like this.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:31.620
Mao is the descendant of a large cormorant family.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:35.430
Cormorant fishing is a tradition as old as China.

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:38.970
Formerly, it was the emperor himself
who gave us permission.

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:41.760
Today, it is enough to be called Wang.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.600
All the cormorant fishermen are called Wang.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:27.990
Whenever Zhong Man is looking for a female, he comes to see Wang Zindzi. As he is no longer old enough to fish, he marries cormorants.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:45.270
Among cormorants, fleeting adventures lead to nothing.

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:49.290
The eggs never open. Only weddings
of love make beautiful children.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:55.440
For Zhong Man, the female who will please
Mao, will be gentle and very enterprising.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:03.630
Cormorants can stay two minutes under
water and dive up to 25 meters deep.

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:21.690
Instinctively, Mao knows where the fish are
hide and Zhong Man trusts him.

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:39.290
Sometimes a cormorant wanders off and gets lost.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:43.700
But the cormorants always return where
they were born and those there were born at Zhong Man.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:56.580
Cormorants eat part of the peach.
The family, another, and the rest is sold.

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:49.500
Here are two females from a good family. For Mahaut, she
should please him. Now it's up to him to choose.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:05.910
With cormorants, it's pretty quick.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.940
And the one who is not chosen does not make a fuss.

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.450
This female is called Princess Celeste.

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:31.170
She will surely give a lot of pleasure to this young king.

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:05.770
For lovers, Zhong Man has prepared
a house out of sight.

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:08.020
In five days he will have eggs.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:00.380
Mao will stay with his princess as long as he pleases.

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:05.570
Zhong Man says it's the custom.
That he'll come back when he's had enough.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.260
But not everyone agrees with this custom.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:35.620
Cormorants make their nest in a few hours
with what they find at the bottom of the river.

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:50.650
Everyone has their role. Mao is working and Princess Celeste is watching.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:15.000
Every hour, Zhong Man leaves his
birds to rest and dry off a bit.

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:19.170
Fishing sometimes lasts all night, sometimes even until morning.

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:28.450
Eggs are not all viable.
But Zhong Man knows how to recognize the good seed.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.450
It can even recognize males from females.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:12.690
For these wild birds to get used to
man, they must be born near man.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:21.330
Zhong Man removes the eggs from the nest very early to entrust them to a hen, preferably lazy, and who is already incubating hers.

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:34.530
The hen covers a Mao egg for 25 days.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:41.070
Zhong Man does not like to wait and every year he leaves
away, looking for new fishing spots.

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:29.670
In the villages where he fishes, he must
give away half of his catch.

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:54.100
We don't know why the fish all congregate
the years at that time where the river is deep.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:59.180
All fishermen also come with their birds.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:53.360
Zhong Man must go home now.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:56.240
He must be there for the hatching of his egg.

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:39.460
If the hen notices the deception, she can
attack the hatchling when it comes out of the egg.

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:45.700
Zhong Man removes the eggs 10 hours before hatching.
He must keep them at the right temperature.

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:18.990
Thus begins for Zhong Man a long
standby period which will last two months.

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:23.190
Two months during which it will be necessary to nourish
the little cormorant every hour,

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:26.370
And make sure he doesn't catch hot or cold.

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:37.350
The first eight days, Zhong Man does not want anyone near the baby.

00:22:37.980 --> 00:22:43.230
He does not leave him.

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:46.800
He doesn't sleep, he can't sleep.

00:22:48.060 --> 00:22:49.620
It won't be out for a week.

00:23:45.510 --> 00:23:49.470
As soon as he can walk, he will follow Zhong Man
and hide in his boots.

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:54.680
In two months, he will accompany the big
on the boat. He will watch them do it.

00:23:57.260 --> 00:23:59.450
In two years, he will be a great fisherman.

00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:04.160
For 20 years he will fish for Zhong Man
and if he is strong, we will marry him off.

00:24:05.120 --> 00:24:10.160
And when he is too old, Zhong Man will make him
drink rice wine so that it goes away smoothly.

00:24:11.330 --> 00:24:16.010
There you go, Zhong Man's family lives like
it since the first millennium.

00:24:17.300 --> 00:24:18.890
There is no reason for that to change.

